              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵagalawice, nipo piŵaweni acacandawo, ŵalwesile mu lina lya AMBUJE. Papopo yakopwece yimbala ngondo yiŵili yayikongwe kutyocela mwitinji, ni yawuleje acacanda 42. ",
          "type": "text",
